Table full name: HTAN_2.HTAN.SCRNASEQ_MSK_SCLC_EPITHELIAL_CELLS_CURRENT
Column name: sex Type: TEXT Description: Phenotypic sex
Column name: cell_type Type: TEXT Description: The type of cell (i.e. T-cell)
